#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:85
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Logic Operators and Ranges"
msgid "Logic operators and ranges"
msgstr "Operatori logici e intervalli"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:91
msgid ""
"You can combine conditions by using `AND` & `OR` as logical operators. Use "
"`TO` to specify ranges for values with an order (e.g. integer or date). "
"Include a limit of the specified range by using square brackets. Exclude it "
"by using curly brackets. You can even combine those brackets, e.g. to "
"include the lower limit and to exclude the upper limit. Nested terms can be "
"achieved by separating them with parentheses `()`."
msgstr ""
"Puoi combinare condizioni usando `AND` e `OR` come operatori logici. Usa "
"`TO` per specificare intervalli per valori con un ordine (ad esempio intero "
"o data). Includi un limite dell'intervallo specificato usando parentesi "
"quadre. Escludilo usando parentesi graffe. Puoi anche combinare queste "
"parentesi, ad esempio per includere il limite inferiore ed escludere quello "
"superiore. I termini nidificati possono essere ottenuti separandoli con "
"parentesi `()`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:93
msgid "`AND` & `OR` with parentheses:"
msgstr "`AND` e `OR` con parentesi:"

#. type: Fenced code block (plain)
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "owner.lastname:brooks AND tags:(internal OR onboarding)\n"
msgstr "owner.lastname:brooks AND tags:(internal OR onboarding)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:99
msgid "`TO` with asterisk wildcard:"
msgstr "`TO` con carattere jolly asterisco:"

#. type: Fenced code block (plain)
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "state.name:open AND article_count: [5 TO *]\n"
msgstr "state.name:open AND article_count: [5 TO *]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:105
msgid "`TO` with excluding one limit of a range:"
msgstr "`TO` con esclusione di un limite di un intervallo:"

#. type: Fenced code block (plain)
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "article.created_at:[2025-03-21 TO 2026-05-19}\n"
msgstr "article.created_at:[2025-03-21 TO 2026-05-19}\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:110
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Fuzzy Search"
msgid "Fuzzy search"
msgstr "Ricerca fuzzy"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:113
msgid ""
"If you are not sure about the exact spelling of a value, use the tilde (`~`) "
"as suffix to perform a fuzzy search."
msgstr ""
"Se non sei sicuro dell'ortografia esatta di un valore, usa la tilde (`~`) "
"come suffisso per eseguire una ricerca fuzzy."

#. type: Fenced code block (plain)
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/search.md:114
#, no-wrap
