"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Update package lists:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper refresh\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Disable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
