#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pagination"
msgstr "Paginazione"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:140
msgid ""
"As Zammad limits the number of returned objects for performance reasons, you "
"may have to use pagination at some points."
msgstr ""
"Poiché Zammad limita il numero di oggetti restituiti per motivi di "
"prestazioni, potresti dover."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:141
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Number of returned objects:** Zammad has hard limits for the\n"
"maximum returned objects. You can't raise these limits.\n"
"\n"
"**Number of total to return objects:** Zammad does not provide a total count of\n"
"objects available for your query, unless you explicitly request it. To include\n"
"the amount of search results, use the `with_total_count` or `only_total_count`\n"
"parameter.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Numero di oggetti restituiti:** Zammad ha limiti rigidi per il\n"
"numero massimo di oggetti restituiti.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:154
msgid ""
"In order to use pagination you'll need two get options: `per_page` and "
"`page`. Combine them to receive 5 results from the first result page: `?"
"page=1&per_page=5` - increase page count to get more results."
msgstr ""
"Per usare la paginazione avrai bisogno di due opzioni get: `per_page` e "
"`page`. Combina."

